title: The Resignation Threat
subtitle: Levi and Zetkin will go if they lose. Should the committee know it?
view-if: congress_cc21 = 1 and congress_closing = 0 and e21_cc_mode = 1 and congress_used_walkout = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.congress_used_walkout = 1;
!}
frequency: 300
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= The Resignation Threat

If Rákosi's resolution passes, Levi will resign the chair, and Zetkin, Däumig, Hoffmann and Brass will go with him. Some members of the committee would think twice if they knew. Nobody knows how many.

- @announce: Say it before the vote.
- @zetkin: Let Clara Zetkin speak instead.
- @keep: Keep it to ourselves.

@announce
subtitle: Many will not risk losing half the Zentrale. Others will not be threatened.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway(0.08 + Math.random() * 0.04);
RG.congress.bitter(4);
!}

Levi tells the committee plainly: the resolution or the Zentrale. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] members who were going to vote with Rákosi think again. ?] Frölich says the party has never before been blackmailed by its own chairman.

@zetkin
subtitle: The oldest voice in the movement, pleading for the majority of the workers.
choose-if: comrade_zetkin = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Zetkin is not here to speak.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway(0.05 + Math.random() * 0.05);
RG.congress.bitter(-1);
!}

Clara Zetkin speaks for half an hour about Italy, where she has never been, and about the masses, whom she has known for forty years. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] members come over. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : She is applauded, and the votes stay where they were. ?]

@keep
subtitle: The committee votes on Italy, and finds out about Levi afterwards.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.bitter(-2);
Q.unity += 2;
!}

Levi says nothing about what he will do.
